The German hyphenation dictionary in this directory
(hyph_de_dehyphn-x-2024-02-28.dic, installed over hyph_de_DE.dic,
hyph_de_AT.dic and hyph_de_CH.dic in the image) is derived from the
dehyph-exptl project — "German Hyphenation Patterns (Reformed Orthography,
2006)", pattern set dehyphn-x, version 2024-02-28.

Upstream: https://ctan.org/pkg/dehyph-exptl
Source:   https://repo.or.cz/wortliste.git

